# =====================================================================
# TIER MODEL  (added 2026-06-02 public-production pass)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Three layers decide where a file is allowed to live:
#   LOCAL  : this machine only — NEVER committed to dev or public.
#            secrets, tokens, personal paths, per-install overrides.
#   DEV    : committed to Calvin-Corbett/thomas-dev (private dev repo).
#            in-progress / dev-stage work lives here.
#   PUBLIC : reaches Calvin-Corbett/thomas (public). The dev->public
#            filter is scripts/forge/publish/preflight.py + the leak
#            guard, NOT this file.
#
# Convention: any file named *.local.* is LOCAL-tier and never tracked.
# Keep sensitive/per-install DATA in a .local.* file and load it from
# generic committed CODE (see public_repo_leak_guard.py for the pattern).
# =====================================================================
*.local.*
!*.local.example

# Sensitive leak blocklist (competitor names) — LOCAL only. The leak
# guard loads it at runtime; it must never reach dev or public.
scripts/forge/gates/leak_blocklist.local.json

